ending the local economy into a depression; and Yurie's pet cat, Tama, goes missing. These two events may have something in common.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-07-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/opiWQY5pM14Jl6S9nqc1yksBxLV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/opiWQY5pM14Jl6S9nqc1yksBxLV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1367386","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The God Association sends Yurie three assistants to help her deal with petitions. As her first task, the Prime Minister summons Yurie to help communicate with a Martian.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-07-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ZoOdTbni6iq5QupaTDkPp5Gl3T.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ZoOdTbni6iq5QupaTDkPp5Gl3T.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1367387","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yurie catches a cold and stays at home for a few days, but her friends don't come to visit. Feeling lonely, she uses her powers to depart from her body as a spirit and visit them instead.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-08-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bIvVPuoVqG7plZ3F6wbTsbXX1ek.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bIvVPuoVqG7plZ3F6wbTsbXX1ek.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1367389","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kiyomi, a freshman, comes to Yurie seeking love advice - but the object of her crush is Kenji. Trying earnestly to help her rival nonetheless, Yurie joins Kenji's calligraphy club with her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-08-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lqAQ0b5g6ftIMj2RqFHIXYLWH5a.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lqAQ0b5g6ftIMj2RqFHIXYLWH5a.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1367391","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"On their summer vacation, Yurie and her friends go to a quiet part of the seashore and explore an abandoned beach house. The gods living there want to know what's become of the people who once enjoyed themselves there, and Yurie fulfills their wish.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-08-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pcH0KiifK4dZxM0R97oQFR67tUD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pcH0KiifK4dZxM0R97oQFR67tUD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1367395","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yurie and her friends meet an old man named Gen who was once a crewman of the battleship Yamato. Shortly afterwards, she receives a message from the sunken battleship, which wants to visit its home port again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-08-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d5evz756Sj2OBjWTU10X7hqIH7n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d5evz756Sj2OBjWTU10X7hqIH7n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1096/season/1/episode/8"},